                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I tried to like this game but I just couldn't overlook certain things in the end. The major one being lag. Totally ruins it for me. Yes the game needs a lot of work let alone the language translation. I'm asking for a refund. Will keep an eye on it though for when it is properly optimised and released. This should surely be listed as early access. I like the concept of the game in general, but at the moment it is not delivering. The bike itself handles less well than in a basic game like Burnout Paradise - totally underwhelming and the ragdoll physics are completely out of place in this game. Large trucks get hit and go flying and rolling through the air like there is no gravity, which wouldn't even be possible on the moon. Game needs lots of work. Might turn out to be a great game in the distant future. After trying for 1.5 hours I requested and got a refund from Steam.",
